    "title": "Allen County prosecutor receives award honoring slain former attorney, magistrate - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Corryn Brock ,\n6 hours ago FORT WAYNE, Ind. (WPTA) - The Allen County Prosecutor’s Office’s chief counsel was honored on Wednesday at the first Conference on Domestic Violence. Tesa Helge received the Marcia Linsky Advocacy Award, which recognizes “exceptional dedication and advocacy for victims of domestic violence in our community,” the prosecutor’s office says. Helge has worked for the agency since 2007, where she currently serves as the Homicide Division leader and previously oversaw the Sex Crimes Division. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
